WEBVTT

00:12:27.993 --> 00:12:31.718
for which the Foundation has created
the Qatar National Research Fund,

00:12:31.718 --> 00:12:36.186
which is really simulated 
against National Science Foundation

00:12:36.186 --> 00:12:39.288
as a funding agency 
that's really promoting research

00:12:39.288 --> 00:12:45.599
and also run a strategy, 
a research on a strategic plan

00:12:45.599 --> 00:12:51.792
where it identifies what is really 
the area where the country is in need

00:12:51.792 --> 00:12:55.504
and where we can make a difference, 
locally and internationally.

00:12:55.504 --> 00:12:57.831
And as a result of that study,

00:12:57.831 --> 00:13:02.912
three major areas have been identified
as a way of moving into the future.